  "title": "vCXLGen: Automated Synthesis and Verification of CXL Bridges for Heterogeneous Architectures",
  "abstract": "Compute Express Link (CXL) offers byte-addressable, cache-coherent remote memory accesses across multiple hosts. Unfortunately, the CXL specification lacks mechanisms to ensure safe interoperability between heterogeneous host architectures with diverse cache coherence (CC) protocols and memory consistency models (MCMs). This semantic gap poses fundamental challenges and a significant barrier to adopting CXL in modern heterogeneous data centers.",
  "abstract_source_id": "src-abstract-asplos-2026-daa39bbc",
